    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.poster.avif?t=1755691725\" width=356 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.webm?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/513ab44d5f14902790dd118d9c5afb4e.mp4?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your business and turn it big! Summon a hat, a chicken, or an Ancient God. Save the world\u2014or don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a summoner-for-hire, you\u2019ve just opened a shop in a medieval town where everyone urgently needs something summoned. New pants? You got it! A pocket dragon? No problem! A swarm of angry bees? Questionable\u2026 but sure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients, draw magic circles (preferably not wonky), and fulfill requests until you run out of money, luck, or patience. (Seriously, what is wrong with these people?!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/c0b0e70c46bb39740fdd8c57927514ee.poster.avif?t=1755691725\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/c0b0e70c46bb39740fdd8c57927514ee.webm?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/c0b0e70c46bb39740fdd8c57927514ee.mp4?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between summoning cats and seductive demons, maybe try to figure out who you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why don\u2019t you remember your life before the shop? How did you even end up in this town? And what\u2019s the deal with that shady Merchant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and about that amnesia\u2014don\u2019t forget to pay your taxes. Or do. Prison\u2019s a perfectly fine place for a nap, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/e8d0bb1adb42e3ce16d5f5009c5a86e3.poster.avif?t=1755691725\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/e8d0bb1adb42e3ce16d5f5009c5a86e3.webm?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/e8d0bb1adb42e3ce16d5f5009c5a86e3.mp4?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might go bankrupt, become a local legend, or accidentally trigger the apocalypse. It\u2019s all up to you. Well\u2026 mostly up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon objects, creatures, and &quot;surprises&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird and wonderful clients with even weirder requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop, stock up on ingredients, learn new rituals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic, absurdity, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings\u2014from legendary success to &quot;welp, that escalated quickly&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door to a world where every order is a chance to make a coin\u2026 or destroy half the town!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your business and turn it big! Summon a hat, a chicken, or an Ancient God. Save the world\u2014or don\u2019t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a summoner-for-hire, you\u2019ve just opened a shop in a medieval town where everyone urgently needs something summoned. New pants? You got it! A pocket dragon? No problem! A swarm of angry bees? Questionable\u2026 but sure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy ingredients, draw magic circles (preferably not wonky), and fulfill requests until you run out of money, luck, or patience. (Seriously, what is wrong with these people?!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/c0b0e70c46bb39740fdd8c57927514ee.poster.avif?t=1755691725\" width=400 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/c0b0e70c46bb39740fdd8c57927514ee.webm?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/c0b0e70c46bb39740fdd8c57927514ee.mp4?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between summoning cats and seductive demons, maybe try to figure out who you really are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why don\u2019t you remember your life before the shop? How did you even end up in this town? And what\u2019s the deal with that shady Merchant?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and about that amnesia\u2014don\u2019t forget to pay your taxes. Or do. Prison\u2019s a perfectly fine place for a nap, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/e8d0bb1adb42e3ce16d5f5009c5a86e3.poster.avif?t=1755691725\" width=400 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/e8d0bb1adb42e3ce16d5f5009c5a86e3.webm?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3576580/extras/e8d0bb1adb42e3ce16d5f5009c5a86e3.mp4?t=1755691725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might go bankrupt, become a local legend, or accidentally trigger the apocalypse. It\u2019s all up to you. Well\u2026 mostly up to you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon objects, creatures, and &quot;surprises&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird and wonderful clients with even weirder requests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your shop, stock up on ingredients, learn new rituals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic, absurdity, and humor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings\u2014from legendary success to &quot;welp, that escalated quickly&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the door to a world where every order is a chance to make a coin\u2026 or destroy half the town!</p>",
    "short_description": "An ancient town needs your magic of summoning. Summon bizarre items and creatures to fulfill townsfolk requests. Earn coins and uncover the strange secrets of the locals. Oh, and try to cure your sudden amnesia. It might just save your life!",
